---
import FieldNotesConstellation from './FieldNotesConstellation.astro';
import {getFieldNotesGraph} from '../../lib/field-notes-graph';
import {nodes as skills} from '../../data/professional/systems';
const graph=await getFieldNotesGraph(),notes=graph.nodes.filter(n=>n.nodeType!=='tool'),books=notes.filter(n=>n.nodeType==='book'),matches=notes.filter(n=>n.nodeType==='cricket');
const actLinks=[['the-last-lecture','mans-search-for-meaning','seven-to-defend-swat-vs-royal-phoenix'],['designing-your-life','educated','the-open-syllabus','tool-worldview'],['good-to-great','blackstone-vs-blackrock','adv-universe','tool-regulatory-lens','tool-adv-screener','tool-manager-search','tool-caia'],['cvc-capital-sports','liberty-media-sports','uber-the-32-billion-hole','figma-the-billion-dollar-bet']];
const slugs=['capital-filings','sports-pe','venture-design','markets-options','founders-infrastructure','meaning-learning'];
---
<section class="unified-story" id="unified-story" data-unified-story data-active-act="1" aria-labelledby="unified-title">
 <header class="unified-intro"><p>C M Nafi / A few things that connect</p><h1 id="unified-title">Attention is finite.<br/><em>Curiosity is a choice.</em></h1><div><p>Books, different rooms, and small experiments. Four acts about how I learned to turn a question into something useful.</p><a href="#story-act-1">Follow the story ↓</a><a href="#home-notebook">Go straight to the notebook ↗</a></div></header>
 <div class="unified-grid"><figure class="unified-stage" aria-label="Four-act interactive story"><header><div><span data-story-act-label>Act I / Finite attention</span><strong data-story-scene-label>Dinajpur · reading was the answer</strong></div><span data-story-stage-count>360 visual beads</span></header><div class="unified-stage-canvas"><FieldNotesConstellation compact /></div><figcaption><p class="unified-caption" data-story-caption>Four chapters, connected by a habit of curiosity.</p><button class="unified-tour" data-story-tour type="button" aria-label="Take the 45-second guided story tour">▷ Take the 45-second guided story tour <span>Space</span></button><nav class="unified-act-nav" aria-label="Choose a storyline act">{['Finite weeks','Small experiments','The right pond','Ideas into tools'].map((name,i)=><a href={`#story-act-${i+1}`} data-story-go={i} aria-current={i===0?'step':undefined}><span>0{i+1}</span>{name}</a>)}</nav><div class="unified-playback"><input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.001" value="0" data-story-progress aria-label="Scrub the four-act story"/><label><input type="checkbox" data-story-still /> Still view</label></div><p class="unified-tour-status" data-story-tour-status role="status">Wheel, touch, or a navigation key pauses the tour.</p></figcaption></figure>
 <div class="unified-acts">
  <article id="story-act-1" data-story-act="1"><p class="unified-kicker">Act I / Finite weeks & the tail end</p><h2>Four thousand weeks.<br/><em>Choose a few well.</em></h2><p>In 2018 I wrote about <i>Man’s Search for Meaning</i>, <i>The Last Lecture</i>, and <i>The Subtle Art of Not Giving a F*ck</i>. Different books, circling the same question: what deserves the attention we have?</p><p>I grew up reading in Dinajpur, left home at twelve for Rangpur Cadet College, and moved to UWC Changshu on a full scholarship at sixteen. College and work took me to the United States. The settings changed. Reading and cricket stayed.</p><div class="unified-route" role="group" aria-label="Choose an early chapter">{['Dinajpur','Rangpur Cadet','UWC China','United States'].map((label,i)=><button type="button" data-story-place={i}>{label}</button>)}</div><button class="unified-toggle" type="button" data-story-tail aria-pressed="false">Toggle: Remaining Books & Cricket Chases</button><div class="unified-tail" data-story-tail-panel hidden><p><strong>{books.length}</strong> book notes and <strong>{matches.length}</strong> match reports documented. What could another stretch of attention hold?</p><div class="unified-assumptions"><label>Planning years<input type="number" min="1" max="80" value="40" data-story-years /></label><label>Books / month<input type="number" min="0" max="12" step="0.5" value="1" data-story-books /></label><label>Matches / year<input type="number" min="0" max="104" value="52" data-story-matches /></label></div><p class="unified-tail-total"><output data-story-future-books>480</output> possible books · <output data-story-future-matches>2,080</output> possible matches</p><small>A planning scenario, not a lifespan estimate. The beads illustrate patterns; they are not a week-by-week biography.</small></div><nav class="unified-reading" aria-label="Reading for finite attention">{actLinks[0].map(id=>{const n=graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id)!;return <a href={n.href}>{n.title}<span>{n.publishedAt} · {n.nodeType==='book'?'Book note':'Match log'}</span></a>})}</nav></article>
  <article id="story-act-2" data-story-act="2"><p class="unified-kicker">Act II / Small experiments</p><h2>A choice can be a test.<br/><em>It needn’t be a verdict.</em></h2><p>My note on <i>Designing Your Life</i> keeps coming back to permission to experiment. A plan can be a hypothesis. A conversation, a class, or a small tool can tell you more than another month of trying to think your way to certainty.</p><p>That habit connects my reading notes to <i>The Open Syllabus</i>: 55 channels, eight learning tracks, five hours a week. Worldview takes the same curiosity into everyday choices, evidence, and reflection.</p><blockquote>Ask a question. Try something small. Notice what changes.</blockquote><nav class="unified-reading" aria-label="Reading and tools for small experiments">{actLinks[1].map(id=>{const n=graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id)!;return <a href={n.href}>{n.title}<span>{n.nodeType==='tool'?n.status:n.publishedAt}</span></a>})}</nav></article>
  <article id="story-act-3" data-story-act="3"><span id="professional" class="unified-anchor" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="unified-kicker">Act III / Choosing the right pond</p><h2>Learn where your mix<br/><em>becomes useful.</em></h2><p>Clinical data pipelines at Mayo Clinic taught me reliability. Screening more than 200 hedge fund profiles at SkyBridge taught me to combine numbers with judgment. At BlackRock, risk reporting and capital-flow dashboards made the story behind a number matter just as much as the calculation.</p><p>A recommendation to read <i>Good to Great</i> stayed with me. Today I’m a solutions engineer at Dasseti, translating between investors and due-diligence software. Independently, I use AI coding tools to turn clearly described research questions into Garage tools.</p><div class="unified-ponds"><span>Clinical data / reliability</span><span>Alternatives / manager selection</span><span>Institutional capital / readable risk</span></div><label class="unified-skill-picker">Inspect one of 42 capabilities<select data-story-skill-picker><option value="">Choose a capability…</option>{skills.map(n=><option value={n.id}>{n.label}</option>)}</select></label><p class="unified-skill-note" data-story-node-copy>Select a capability to see the work or concept it represents.</p><button class="unified-toggle" type="button" data-story-focus aria-pressed="false">Highlight the Wrong Trees I Skip</button><p class="unified-boundaries" data-story-boundaries hidden>Outside my focus: sell-side equity research, pure HFT quant roles, and long non-technical sales cycles. These are preferences, not judgments about those careers.</p><nav class="unified-reading" aria-label="Professional reading and independent tools">{actLinks[2].map(id=>{const n=graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id)!;return <a href={n.href}>{n.title}<span>{n.nodeType==='tool'?n.status:n.publishedAt}</span></a>})}</nav></article>
  <article id="story-act-4" data-story-act="4"><p class="unified-kicker">Act IV / Ideas into tools</p><h2>Every answer leaves<br/><em>another question.</em></h2><p>Sports ownership, Uber’s financing, Canva and Figma, or seven runs to defend in the final over: I keep returning to how decisions change a system, and what the numbers leave out.</p><p>An essay can suggest a tool. A tool can reveal a better question. This is the notebook behind that loop: <strong>{notes.length} published notes</strong> and <strong>{graph.nodes.length-notes.length} related tools</strong>, connected by six reading tracks.</p><a class="unified-archive-cta" href="/field-notes/" data-story-open-archive>Open the full interactive archive →</a><nav class="unified-spines" aria-label="Open a reading track in the archive">{graph.tracks.map((t,i)=><a href={`/field-notes/?spine=${slugs[i]}`} data-story-spine={slugs[i]}><span>0{t.id}</span>{t.short} ↗</a>)}</nav><nav class="unified-reading" aria-label="Essays behind the idea constellation">{actLinks[3].map(id=>{const n=graph.nodes.find(n=>n.id===id)!;return <a href={n.href}>{n.title}<span>{n.publishedAt}</span></a>})}</nav></article>
 </div></div>
 <footer class="unified-sources"><p>Reading prompts: Tim Urban’s <a href="https://waitbutwhy.com/2014/05/life-weeks.html">Your Life in Weeks</a>, <a href="https://waitbutwhy.com/2015/12/the-tail-end.html">The Tail End</a>, and <a href="https://waitbutwhy.com/2018/04/picking-career.html">career-fit essay</a>; Eric Barker on <a href="https://bakadesuyo.com/2023/02/find-your-passion/">small experiments</a>. The personal reflections above are grounded in my linked book notes.</p><p>Map connections describe city-centre geography, not recorded flights. Architecture and bead motion are illustrative. Employer work and independent projects remain distinct. <a href="https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/">Land outlines: Natural Earth, public domain.</a></p></footer>
</section>
<script>
import {StoryDirectorController,storyEase} from '../../lib/StoryDirectorController';
import {tailScenario} from '../../lib/story-layouts';
function initUnified(){const candidate=document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-unified-story]');if(!candidate||candidate.dataset.ready)return;const root:HTMLElement=candidate,stage=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.unified-stage')!,atlas=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-idea-atlas]')!,steps=[...root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-story-act]')],button=root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-story-tour]')!,scrub=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-story-progress]')!,still=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-story-still]')!,motion=matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');let progress=0,tail=false,focus=false,reduced=motion.matches,lastAct=0,lastPhase=-1;const phaseNames=['Dinajpur · reading was the answer','Rangpur Cadet · structure away from home','UWC Changshu · learning self-reliance','United States · different rooms, one habit'];
 const director=new StoryDirectorController(p=>{render(p,true);scrollFor(p,true);},state=>{root.dataset.tourState=state;button.textContent=state==='playing'?'Ⅱ Pause the guided tour':state==='complete'?'↻ Take the 45-second guided story tour again':'▷ Take the 45-second guided story tour';button.setAttribute('aria-label',state==='playing'?'Pause the guided story tour':'Take the 45-second guided story tour');button.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(state==='playing'));root.querySelector('[data-story-tour-status]')!.textContent=state==='playing'?'Tour running. Wheel, touch, or a navigation key pauses.':state==='complete'?'Tour complete. Explore a thread or choose another act.':'Tour paused. Explore freely or resume.';});
 function render(p:number,auto=false){progress=Math.max(0,Math.min(.999999,p));const act=Math.min(4,Math.floor(progress*4)+1),local=progress*4-(act-1);scrub.value=String(progress);root.dataset.activeAct=String(act);root.querySelector('[data-story-act-label]')!.textContent=['Act I / Finite attention','Act II / Small experiments','Act III / The right pond','Act IV / Ideas into tools'][act-1];root.querySelector('[data-story-scene-label]')!.textContent=act===1?phaseNames[Math.min(3,Math.floor(local*4))]:act===2?'Questions → books → notes → tools':act===3?'Three industries. 42 connected capabilities.':'64 notes + 7 related tools';root.querySelector('[data-story-caption]')!.textContent=act===1?(tail?'23 book notes · 5 match logs · an adjustable next chapter':'360 beads; the layouts illustrate chapters, not individual weeks.'):act===2?'Eight learning tracks, with small experiments between them.':act===3?'A conceptual architecture, not an employer system diagram.':'Follow a node here, or continue into the full reading atlas.';
  root.querySelectorAll('[data-story-go]').forEach((a,i)=>{if(i===act-1)a.setAttribute('aria-current','step');else a.removeAttribute('aria-current');});const tourTail=auto&&act===1&&local>.83,tourFocus=auto&&act===3&&local>.65;atlas.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('story:scene',{detail:{act,local,tail:tail||tourTail,focus:focus||tourFocus,reduce:reduced}}));if(auto&&act===4){const phase=Math.min(2,Math.floor(local*3));if(lastAct!==4||lastPhase!==phase){atlas.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('story:select',{detail:{id:['blackstone-vs-blackrock','adv-universe','tool-regulatory-lens'][phase]}}));lastPhase=phase;}}lastAct=act;
 }
 function scrollFor(p:number,auto=false){const index=Math.min(3,Math.floor(Math.min(.99999,p)*4)),local=p*4-index,rect=steps[index].getBoundingClientRect(),probe=innerWidth<900?stage.offsetHeight+72:innerHeight*.5,phase=auto?storyEase(local):local;window.scrollTo({top:Math.max(0,rect.top+scrollY+rect.height*phase-probe),behavior:'instant'});}
 function onScroll(){if(director.playing)return;const probe=innerWidth<900?stage.getBoundingClientRect().bottom+innerHeight*.2:innerHeight*.5;let index=0;for(let i=0;i<steps.length;i++)if(steps[i].getBoundingClientRect().top<=probe)index=i;const r=steps[index].getBoundingClientRect(),local=Math.max(0,Math.min(.99999,(probe-r.top)/r.height));render((index+local)/4);}
 function pause(){director.pause();}function key(e:KeyboardEvent){if((e.target as Element)?.closest('input,select,textarea,button,a,[contenteditable]'))return;if(e.code==='Space'){e.preventDefault();if(!reduced)director.toggle();}else if(['ArrowUp','ArrowDown','PageUp','PageDown','Home','End','Escape'].includes(e.key))pause();}
 button.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!reduced)director.toggle();});root.querySelectorAll<HTMLAnchorElement>('[data-story-go]').forEach((a,i)=>a.addEventListener('click',e=>{e.preventDefault();director.seek((i+.12)/4);scrollFor((i+.12)/4);render((i+.12)/4);}));root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-story-place]').forEach((b,i)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{pause();render((i+.45)/16);}));scrub.addEventListener('input',()=>{pause();const p=Number(scrub.value);scrollFor(p);render(p);});root.querySelector('[data-story-tail]')!.addEventListener('click',e=>{pause();tail=!tail;(e.currentTarget as HTMLElement).setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(tail));root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-story-tail-panel]')!.hidden=!tail;render(progress);});root.querySelector('[data-story-focus]')!.addEventListener('click',e=>{pause();focus=!focus;(e.currentTarget as HTMLElement).setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(focus));root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-story-boundaries]')!.hidden=!focus;render(progress);});
 function scenario(){const years=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-story-years]')!,books=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-story-books]')!,matches=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-story-matches]')!;const result=tailScenario(Math.min(80,Number(years.value)),Math.min(12,Number(books.value)),Math.min(104,Number(matches.value)));root.querySelector('[data-story-future-books]')!.textContent=result.books.toLocaleString();root.querySelector('[data-story-future-matches]')!.textContent=result.matches.toLocaleString();}root.querySelectorAll('[data-story-years],[data-story-books],[data-story-matches]').forEach(i=>i.addEventListener('input',scenario));root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('[data-story-skill-picker]')!.addEventListener('change',e=>atlas.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('story:skill',{detail:{id:(e.target as HTMLSelectElement).value}})));const skill=(event:Event)=>{const detail=(event as CustomEvent).detail;root.querySelector('[data-story-node-copy]')!.textContent=`${detail.title}: ${detail.summary}`;};atlas.addEventListener('story:inspected',skill);
 function setMotion(){reduced=motion.matches||still.checked;still.checked=reduced;button.disabled=reduced;if(reduced)pause();render(progress);}motion.addEventListener('change',setMotion);still.addEventListener('change',setMotion);const visibility=()=>{if(document.hidden)pause();};window.addEventListener('scroll',onScroll,{passive:true});window.addEventListener('resize',onScroll);window.addEventListener('wheel',pause,{passive:true});window.addEventListener('touchstart',pause,{passive:true});window.addEventListener('keydown',key);document.addEventListener('visibilitychange',visibility);const atlasReady=()=>render(progress);atlas.addEventListener('atlas:ready',atlasReady);root.dataset.ready='true';root.dataset.tourState='paused';setMotion();onScroll();
 function cleanup(){atlas.removeEventListener('atlas:ready',atlasReady);director.destroy();window.removeEventListener('scroll',onScroll);window.removeEventListener('resize',onScroll);window.removeEventListener('wheel',pause);window.removeEventListener('touchstart',pause);window.removeEventListener('keydown',key);document.removeEventListener('visibilitychange',visibility);motion.removeEventListener('change',setMotion);atlas.removeEventListener('story:inspected',skill);document.removeEventListener('astro:before-swap',cleanup);}document.addEventListener('astro:before-swap',cleanup);
}
initUnified();document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',initUnified);
</script>
<style>
.unified-story{font-family:var(--font-sans);color:var(--text-primary)}.unified-intro{padding:4rem 0 3rem;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:1rem 3rem}.unified-intro>p{grid-column:1/-1;font:10px var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--ink-forest)}.unified-intro h1{font:450 clamp(3.3rem,6.2vw,6rem)/1 'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.04em}.unified-intro h1 em{font-weight:400}.unified-intro>div{align-self:end;max-width:390px}.unified-intro>div p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-secondary)}.unified-intro a{display:inline-block;color:var(--ink-forest);font-size:11px;margin:15px 18px 0 0}.unified-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:44% 56%;align-items:start;min-height:420vh}.unified-stage{grid-column:2;grid-row:1;position:sticky;top:4.5rem;height:calc(100svh - 6rem);min-height:550px;max-height:1050px;margin:0;border:1px solid var(--border-hairline);background:var(--bg-canvas);display:flex;flex-direction:column;overflow:hidden;z-index:5}.unified-stage>header{height:96px;min-height:96px;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:15px;padding:15px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-hairline)}.unified-stage>header div>span{display:block;color:var(--ink-forest);font:8px var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em}.unified-stage strong{display:block;font:21px/1.2 'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;margin-top:5px}.unified-stage [data-story-stage-count]{font:8px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-muted);align-self:center;white-space:nowrap}.unified-stage-canvas{min-height:0;flex:1;position:relative}.unified-stage figcaption{padding:0 12px 10px;border-top:1px solid var(--border-hairline)}.unified-caption{font:italic 12px/1.4 'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;color:var(--text-secondary);margin:8px 0;height:34px}.unified-tour{height:38px;box-sizing:border-box;display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;font:11px var(--font-sans);border:1px solid var(--ink-forest);color:var(--ink-forest);background:var(--bg-surface);padding:10px;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:8px}.unified-tour span{float:right;font:8px var(--font-mono);border:1px solid var(--border-hairline);padding:2px}.unified-tour:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}.unified-act-nav{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:4px}.unified-act-nav a{padding:7px 6px;border:1px solid var(--border-hairline);font-size:8px;color:var(--text-secondary)}.unified-act-nav a span{display:block;font:8px var(--font-mono);color:var(--text-muted);margin-bottom:4px}.unified-act-nav a[aria-current]{border-color:var(--ink-forest);color:var(--ink-forest);background:var(--bg-subtle)}.unified-playback{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:9px}.unified-playback>input{flex:1;min-width:0;accent-color:var(--ink-vermilion)}.unified-playback label{display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;white-space:nowrap;font-size:9px;color:var(--text-muted)}.unified-playback label input{accent-color:var(--ink-forest)}.unified-tour-status{height:24px;overflow:hidden;font-size:8px;color:var(--text-muted);line-height:1.5;margin:4px 0 0}.unified-acts{grid-column:1;grid-row:1;padding-right:3rem}.unified-acts article{min-height:108svh;box-sizing:border-box;padding:5rem 0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;scroll-margin-top:5rem;position:relative}.unified-kicker{font:9px/1.6 var(--font-mono);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-vermilion);margin-bottom:1.5rem}.unified-acts h2{font:450 clamp(2.2rem,3.5vw,3.5rem)/1.05 'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.025em;margin:0 0 1.5rem}.unified-acts h2 em{font-weight:400}.unified-acts article>p:not(.unified-kicker){font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--text-secondary);margin-bottom:1rem}.unified-reading{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:7px;margin-top:1.5rem}.unified-reading a{font-size:10px;line-height:1.4;color:var(--ink-forest);border:1px solid var(--border-hairline);padding:8px 10px;max-width:100%;backgrou